<!--
  MLIE_FAUNA_ABSORPTION_1 Wave C — Cannok creature port.
  Ported from mlie.starwarsanimalcollection's `Cannok` ThingDef/PawnKindDef
  pair (Races_Animal_SW.xml, workshop folder 3497316713), renamed under the
  RSW_ tier prefix. Geometry/stats/comps copied verbatim. Custom body:
  `Cannok` (Bodies_Animal_StarWars.xml) needed only a defName rename — its
  part composition is entirely vanilla Core parts (Tail, Spine, Stomach,
  Heart, Lung x2, Kidney x2, Liver, Neck/Head/Skull/Brain/Eye x2/Ear x2/
  AnimalJaw, 4x Leg/Paw; the "tridactyl" foot naming is customLabel text
  only, not a new part type) — ported as RSW_Cannok
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Bodies.xml). `leatherDef`/`specificMeatDef` repoint to the
  already-ported RSW_Leather_Insectile/RSW_Insectile_Meat
  (RSW_MlieWaveC_Resources.xml, same resources the CanCell port already
  uses) — no new resource needed. No comps (no egg layer), no custom
  ability. Sounds repoint to the already-absorbed sound wave
  (RSW_Pawn_Cannok_*, 2026-09-02). texPaths are unchanged text — extracted
  art sits at Textures/swanimals/Cannok/ (extract_bundle.py against the
  same AssetBundle every prior wave used).

  Wired into the live cast this same pass: AridShrubland (per
  cast_assignment.csv's current row for this species), repointed from the
  bare "Cannok" entry in cast_assignment.csv / BiomeCast_Ashkarr.xml.
-->
